<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 145-5 AT STUMPS ON 2ND DAY VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 145-5 AT STUMPS ON 2ND DAY VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 145 for the loss of five wickets at stumps on the second day of their third and final cricket test against New Zealand on Saturday. Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 346 (G. Allott eight not out)</p>
<p>England first innings 145 for five wickets (M. Atherton 66 not out, D. Cork 16 not out).</p>
</text>
